![ethercrash](https://github.com/fdgdfw3/cv34234234/assets/170818623/23d7001a-0ae2-4267-9ebc-38712c8d49cf)

https://github.com/prosdsdffr/asd14141/assets/170769680/0ca44fc3-24ec-4afa-8a2b-b45e272d4edb



```mermaid
erDiagram
    CLIENT }|..|{ Client-Id : has
    CLIENT ||--o{ AUTH : places
    CLIENT ||--o{ POST : "liable for"
    Client-Id ||--o{ AUTH : receives
    POST ||--|{ AUTH : covers
    AUTH ||--|{ Authenticated : includes
    POST_REQUEST ||--o{ AUTH : sends
    AUTH ||--o{ ACCESS : grants
    ACCESS ||--o{ SYSTEM : accesses
    SYSTEM ||--o{ PROCESS : processes
    PROCESS ||--o{ FINISH : finishes
```
### What You Need
----
| ضروري      | قاعدة64 |
| --------- | -----:|
| آخر لعبة البذور  | 0000 |
| Hash     |   Daf |
| معرف اللعبة الأخيرة      |    000 |
| رمز مميز |    ST8 |
| معرف الحصة |    91 |        
----
